  "bodyHash": "a92e7f91b54596d3",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>（適用於 Fabric）</em></h3>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 提供高效的多方塊同時採集模式。只需在 Minecraft 按鍵設定畫面中按住指定的按鍵即可啟動模組，收集到的物品會直接掉落在您腳下，讓您無需四處奔波！在 1.15 及以上版本中，該模組透過在將要開採的方塊周圍顯示白色線條來增強可視性，不僅能清楚標示您的開採範圍，外觀也更加酷炫！</p>\n<p>前往我們的文件網站閱讀更多關於 FTB Ultimine 的資訊：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p>\n<h4><strong>支援與需求</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com//assets/a1/mods/supports-fabric@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>搭配模組</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高效方塊採集</strong>：按住可自訂的 ` / ~ 按鍵，即可同時採集多個方塊，簡化您的開採流程。</li>\n<li><strong>視覺效果強化（1.15+）</strong>：體驗更直觀的視覺提示，系統會在準備開採、採收或犁地的方塊周圍顯示白色線條，讓您清楚掌握操作範圍，再也不怕誤操作！</li>\n<li><strong>鋤頭犁地功能</strong>：將功能延伸至農業，使用鋤頭對著草地進行操作，即可像開採一樣一次犁地多個方塊，節省您的時間與精力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物採收</strong>：透過右鍵點擊即可簡化作物採收過程，提供一種輕鬆無縫的資源收集方式。</li>\n<li><strong>草地方塊特殊處理</strong>：充分利用對草地方塊的獨特處理機制，有效管理超出標準 1 格範圍的類似草地方塊。</li>\n<li><strong>開採輔助</strong>：透過 Ultimine，您可以輕鬆挖掘隧道，無論是向上或向下延伸階梯，或是通往下一座礦道，皆能一鍵完成！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 專為優化您的開採與農業活動而設計，提供流暢且高效的遊戲體驗。它已收錄於我們的多款整合包以及其他眾多整合包中！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您也可以像這樣使用鋤頭對著草地操作，一次犁地多個方塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>並透過右鍵點擊來採收作物：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草地方塊具有特殊處理機制，會搜尋超過 1 格距離的方塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>支援與協助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若遇到<strong>整合包</strong>相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若遇到<strong>模組</strong>相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何疑問嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持關注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
